# A reader who chose the Theme app icon has a desktop entry of Omaweb's in
# their home, and Omarchy's menu lists it whether or not the browser is still
# installed: it does not read the entry's TryExec. The package cannot reach
# into a home, so it says where the entry is.
post_remove() {
    cat <<'NOTICE'
If you chose the Theme app icon in Omaweb's Settings, delete
~/.local/share/applications/omaweb.desktop so the menu stops listing Omaweb.
NOTICE
}
